# 仅发送产品构建、发布声明覆盖层所需文件。
# 指定的 Dockerfile 与本文件仍由构建器自动读取。
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src/
!src/**
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!deploy/
deploy/**
!deploy/entrypoint.sh
!docs/
docs/**
!docs/third-party/
docs/third-party/**
!docs/third-party/rust/
!docs/third-party/rust/**
!docs/third-party/nested/
!docs/third-party/nested/**
!docs/third-party/runtime/
!docs/third-party/runtime/**

# 即使误放在源码目录，仍排除本机配置和临时文件。
**/*.local.json
**/*.local.yaml
**/*.local.yml
**/.env*
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.log
**/*.log.*
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
